      "writtenOn": "2026-02-10T15:15:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m pretty sure that you can apply a schema to arbitrary values and don\u0027t necessarily need to match to a specific key, so this would be fine. We would want to make sure these are all under their own key to avoid conflicts. eg:\n\n```\n...\n fVarations: {\n    \"wght\": 800,\n    \"slnt\":  -5\n  }\n```",
